{"id":"sem_desyat","lemma":"семьдесят","pos":"num","rank":4396,"glosses":["seventy (70)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b0/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BC%D1%8C%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%82.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BC%D1%8C%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%82.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это правда, что ему за семьдесят.","en":"It is true that he is over seventy.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"truth (conformity to…"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]},{"text":"Том умер в семьдесят лет.","en":"Tom died in his seventies.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"}]},{"text":"Том потерял семьдесят фунтов.","en":"Tom lost seventy pounds.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to lose, to waste","l":"потерять"},null,{"g":"pound","l":"фунт"}]},{"text":"Том умер, когда ему было семьдесят лет.","en":"Tom died when he was seventy years old.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"}]},{"text":"Моему дедушке в этом году будет семьдесят.","en":"My grandfather will be seventy this year.","words":[{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},null,{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]}]}